From 27a6a400958696d778f73adcdea13dd2b8a189ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andre Vehreschild <vehre@gmx.de>
Date: Fri, 28 Mar 2025 14:59:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Improve teams implementation

Improve the implementation of team's functions to adhere to the Fortran
2018 standard and gfortran from 16 on.
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                |  13 +-
 src/application-binary-interface/libcaf.h     |  43 +-
 src/runtime-libraries/mpi/mpi_caf.c           | 569 +++++++++++++++---
 src/tests/unit/teams/CMakeLists.txt           |   7 +-
 src/tests/unit/teams/team_number.f90          |  68 +++
 ...{team-number.f90 => team_number_pre15.f90} |   0
 src/tests/unit/teams/teams_num_images.f90     |  52 ++
 src/tests/unit/teams/teams_this_image.f90     | 108 ++++
 8 files changed, 759 insertions(+), 101 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/tests/unit/teams/team_number.f90
 rename src/tests/unit/teams/{team-number.f90 => team_number_pre15.f90} (100%)
 create mode 100644 src/tests/unit/teams/teams_num_images.f90
 create mode 100644 src/tests/unit/teams/teams_this_image.f90

